&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Associate Account Manager, you will collaborate with your clients to gain a deep understanding of their unique business objectives and design digital strategies to drive tangible outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing as an Associate Account Manager:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary strategic lead for a portfolio of industrial clients to cultivate strong and trusted partnerships with each of them&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, collect, and document client goals and deliverable feedback for use by cross-functional teams (coordinators, design, development, and SEM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams to execute marketing campaigns, ensure alignment with client expectations, and deliver on ROI&lt;/li&gt;
