&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;10+ years of progressive HR experience, with at least 5+ years as a dedicated HRBP supporting Product, Design, and Engineering organizations in high-growth, scaling technology companies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
