&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree, 1 to 2 years of experience, exposure to manufacturing, supply chain, or a technical/engineering background a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
