&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Hiring &amp;amp; Calibration: Experience hiring, calibrating, and growing computational-geometry talent — a domain where the global talent pool is small and the hiring bar is notoriously difficult to set&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
