&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This role is ideal for candidates who are achievement-oriented and will think outside-the-box to exceed annual sales goals through strong collaboration with partners and internal stakeholders. The ideal candidate is success-driven, is capable of multi-tasking, can lead a cross-functional team, and enjoys a dynamic and evolving environment. In this role, you will be an integral part of the Xometry sales team, spending your days in constant communication with teammates, internal stakeholders, and customers, all while developing or strengthening a deep understanding of the 50 billion dollar addressable market within the U.S. for custom manufacturing.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
