&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Conduct deep dives into account trends and gather direct sales feedback to inform pricing strategies and product enhancements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
