&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Exceptional storytelling and executive communication skills; able to distill complex, multi-variable analysis into a clear narrative and recommendation for non-technical audiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
