&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Strategic Advantage: Why This Role is Different&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Unlike typical software integrations—which function as lightweight UI overlays—this partnership represents a fundamental shift. You will be building a deeply coupled digital thread.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Native Geometry:&lt;/strong&gt; You will work directly on the ecosystem&#39;s native 3D geometry, providing a level of accuracy and speed impossible on neutral formats.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;
