&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Xometry (NASDAQ: XMTR) powers the industries of today and tomorrow by connecting the people with big ideas to the manufacturers who can bring them to life. Xometry’s digital marketplace gives manufacturers the critical resources they need to grow their business while also making it easy for buyers at Fortune 1000 companies to tap into global manufacturing capacity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Xometry (NASDAQ: XMTR) is the global source for on-demand manufacturing, transforming one of the largest industries in the world. Our AI-driven marketplace connects buyers—ranging from independent engineers and designers to Fortune 100 procurement teams—with a global network of over 10,000 manufacturing partners. We provide instant pricing, lead times, and manufacturability feedback for custom parts, empowering the creators of today to build the products of tomorrow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Xometry is seeking a visionary and results-oriented &lt;strong&gt;Staff Data Scientist&lt;/strong&gt; to lead data science across key product and business problems, using analytics, experimentation, statistical methods, and machine learning to drive better decisions and measurable outcomes.&lt;strong&gt; As a founding Data Scientist for Xometry’s India PDT team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will also help establish strong data practices, build cross-region trust and collaboration, and foster a culture of innovation and execution as the organization scales.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
