&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Partner Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the design and delivery of production ML solutions that embed Xometry’s AI into our partner&#39;s ecosystem workflows. You will shift our technology from vertically integrated services to SaaS solutions that can be integrated into multiple environments, enabling real-time feedback loops.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
